'' A STATIC LOCAL OBJECT, constructed lazily: the guard flag, the constructor at the
'' declaration, and the destructor registered with atexit through a thunk of its own.
'' Measured against fbc, which emits exactly that and one guard PER DECLARATION --
'' including for a static inside an IF, which is not constructed until the branch runs.
'' A type with no destructor gets no thunk; a scalar static gets no guard at all.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/mir/src/static-object.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: verify: ok
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered
'' GOLDEN: expected/static-object.out
